            "Three godsword shards smith into the blade for free."));

        RECIPES = Collections.unmodifiableList(r);
    }

    private RecipeCatalog()
    {
    }

    /** Immutable list of all bundled recipes. */
    public static List<Recipe> all()
    {
        return RECIPES;
    }
}

